  m_Text: 'A                         Move Left

    D                         Move
    Right

    SPACE / W                 Jump

    B                         Open
    Backpack

    N                         Open Forge

    ENTER                    
    Advance Dialogue

    I                         Throw Kunai


    BACKPACK EQUIPMENT

    Slot
    1: Sword    Slot 2: Shield    Slot 3: Red Rune


    FORGING

    Select equipment
    on the left, then press the centre Forge button.

    Only swords and shields
    can currently be forged.

    A failed attempt lowers the equipment''s upgrade
    level.'
